pg | query | dev | BEGIN | DENY forbidden
pg | query | dev | COMMIT | DENY forbidden
pg | query | dev | ROLLBACK | DENY forbidden
pg | query | dev | SET statement_timeout = 0 | DENY forbidden
pg | query | dev | SET LOCAL statement_timeout = 0 | DENY forbidden
pg | query | dev | RESET ALL | DENY forbidden
