# A name before a column list (an alias, a CTE) isn't a call there; another use of the same name is.
pg | query | dev | WITH dblink_exec(x) AS (SELECT 1) SELECT count(*) OVER (PARTITION BY dblink_exec('dbname=app', 'x')) FROM dblink_exec | DENY function-denied
